{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43124","headline":"村行 · 姚揆","name":"村行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天淡雨初晴，游人恨不胜。\n乱山啼蜀魄，孤櫂宿巴陵。\n影暗村桥柳，光寒水寺灯。\n罢吟思故国，窗外有渔罾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚揆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}